  "headline": "Hall and Saka impress on England duty",
  "summary": "BBC Sport’s assessment of England’s international break highlights Newcastle’s Lewis Hall and Arsenal’s Bukayo Saka. Hall strengthened his claim to the left-back position across three matches after Manchester City’s Nico O’Reilly returned to his club injured. Saka, whose World Cup was affected by an Achilles problem, scored twice against Croatia. Their performances give England manager Thomas Tuchel encouraging options as the players return to their clubs.",
